    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Efficiency by agent",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "One row per agent that completed a run in the selected range; idle agents drop out.\n\n**Re-read** is the key idea: every turn re-sends the whole conversation, so a run costs roughly *context x turns*. Nothing ever leaves a context.\n\n| column | meaning |\n|---|---|\n| **agent** | the subagent, by name |\n| **team** | which agent system it belongs to |\n| **runs** | dispatches completed in range |\n| **avg turns** | assistant turns per run \u2014 loop length *(orange 120, red 250)* |\n| **Bash/run** | shell calls per run \u2014 a loop on tests or a build shows here first *(orange 50, red 100)* |\n| **avg s/run** | wall-clock per run, excluding runs that waited on you *(orange 10m, red 30m)* |\n| **avg out tok** | tokens written per run \u2014 the only tokens that are real work |\n| **avg ctx/turn** | mean window carried on each turn; explains most other columns *(orange 150k, red 250k)* |\n| **peak ctx** | largest window ever reached \u2014 all-time, ignores the time picker *(orange 200k, red 400k)* |\n| **re-read** | total context re-sent across all runs in range \u2014 where the tokens went |\n| **re-read/run** | the same, per dispatch |\n| **per out tok** | re-read \u00f7 output \u2014 thought a lot, wrote little *(orange 400, red 600)* |\n| **blocked** | runs whose clock spanned a wait for a human answer *(orange 1, red 5)* |",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 12,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": {
          "show": false,
          "reducer": [
            "sum"
          ],
          "fields": ""
        },
        "sortBy": [
          {
            "displayName": "re-read",
            "desc": true
          }
        ]
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            },
            "minWidth": 70
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "avg turns"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "decimals",
                "value": 0
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-background",
                  "mode": "gradient"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "thresholds",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "absolute",
                  "steps": [
                    {
                      "color": "transparent",
                      "value": null
